### Homework / Grades / Assessments V1 API Smoke Tests
### Replace all placeholders before running.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@adminToken = REPLACE_WITH_SCHOOL_ADMIN_TOKEN
@teacherToken = REPLACE_WITH_TEACHER_TOKEN
@studentToken = REPLACE_WITH_STUDENT_TOKEN
@parentToken = REPLACE_WITH_PARENT_TOKEN

@assessmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@questionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000002
@studentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000003
@submissionId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000004
@answerId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000005
@homeworkId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000006
@classId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000007
@assignmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000008
@attachmentId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000009

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Dashboard Grades Bootstrap / Overview
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/bootstrap
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/overview
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Dashboard Grades Assessments
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{assessmentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create score-only assessment - adjust body to current DTO fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Midterm Assessment",
  "maxScore": 100,
  "weight": 1
}

### Create question-based assessment - adjust body to current DTO fields
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/question-based
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Question Based Quiz",
  "maxScore": 20,
  "weight": 1
}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/approve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/lock
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Grade items list
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Single GradeItem upsert - dashboard-only
PUT {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/items/{{studentId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 95,
  "notes": "Manual dashboard entry"
}

### Bulk GradeItem upsert - dashboard-only
PUT {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/items
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "studentId": "{{studentId}}", "score": 95 }
  ]
}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Dashboard Grades Questions / Submissions / Review
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create question - adjust body to DTO
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "type": "short_answer",
  "prompt": "Explain the concept.",
  "points": 5
}

### Reorder questions - adjust body to DTO
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/questions/reorder
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "items": [
    { "questionId": "{{questionId}}", "sortOrder": 1 }
  ]
}

### Submissions list
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/submissions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Resolve submission - adjust body to DTO
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades/assessments/{{assessmentId}}/submissions/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "studentId": "{{studentId}}"
}

### Review answer - adjust body to DTO
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/grades/submissions/{{submissionId}}/answers/{{answerId}}/review
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "score": 5,
  "feedback": "Good answer"
}

### Finalize review
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades/submissions/{{submissionId}}/review/finalize
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Sync reviewed submission to GradeItem
POST {{baseUrl}}/grades/submissions/{{submissionId}}/sync-grade-item
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Dashboard Gradebook / Analytics / Rules
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/gradebook
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/students/{{studentId}}/snapshot
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/analytics/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/analytics/distribution
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/rules
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/grades/rules/effective
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### -------------------------------------------------------------------------
### Dashboard Homework Core
### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{baseUrl}}/homework/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Create homework - adjust body to DTO
POST {{baseUrl}}/homework/assignments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Homework Assignment",
  "description": "Practice tasks",
  "mode": "questions"
}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/homework/assignments/{{homeworkId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/homework/assignments/{{homeworkId}}/publish
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/homework/assignments/{{homeworkId}}/close
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

###
POST {{baseUrl}}/homework/assignments/{{homeworkId}}/cancel
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Targets
GET {{baseUrl}}/homework/assignments/{{homeworkId}}/targets
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Resolve targets
POST {{baseUrl}}/homework/assignments/{{homeworkId}}/targets/resolve
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Questions
GET {{baseUrl}}/homework/assignments/{{homeworkId}}/questions
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Attachments
GET {{baseUrl}}/homework/assignments/{{homeworkId}}/attachments
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Submission answers
GET {{baseUrl}}/homework/assignments/{{homeworkId}}/submissions/{{submissionId}}/answers
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Homework grade sync status
GET {{baseUrl}}/homework/assignments/{{homeworkId}}/grade-sync
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Link homework to grade assessment - adjust body to DTO
POST {{baseUrl}}/homework/assignments/{{homeworkId}}/grade-sync/link
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assessmentId": "{{assessmentId}}"
}

### Sync all reviewed submissions
POST {{baseUrl}}/homework/assignments/{{homeworkId}}/grade-sync
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### Sync one reviewed submission
POST {{baseUrl}}/homework/assignments/{{homeworkId}}/submissions/{{submissionId}}/grade-sync
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

