### -------------------------------------------------------------------------

GET {{baseUrl}}/parent/children/{{studentId}}/homeworks
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

###
GET {{baseUrl}}/parent/children/{{studentId}}/homeworks/{{homeworkId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}

### Parent homework mutation should remain absent / unsupported in V1
POST {{baseUrl}}/parent/children/{{studentId}}/homeworks/{{homeworkId}}/submit
Authorization: Bearer {{parentToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{}

